# Wi-Fi firmware SilverOS ships: the common laptop and desktop cards of the last ten years.
# Paths are inside linux-firmware (tag below); scripts/fetch.sh downloads them and records their
# checksums, scripts/build-rootfs.sh copies them to /lib/firmware (Intel's flattened, as the
# kernel asks for them). Licences: firmware/LICENSES (the WHENCE entries and licence files).
#
# Intel (iwlwifi): 7265D, 8265, 9260, 9560/9461/9462 (Qu/QuZ jf), AX200 (cc), AX201 (Qu/QuZ hr),
# AX210/AX211 (ty/so/ma gf), BE200/BE201/BE202 (bz/gl/sc fm)
